      "description": "When reliability matters, Martex ® Simplicity T180 sheets deliver. Crafted to meet the high demands of institutional use, these lab tested sheets strike the perfect balance between comfort, durability, and affordability—making them a trusted choice for dormitories, hospitals, military housing, and more.\n\nEngineered for longevity, the sheets are constructed with a crisp percale weave that offers a soft, inviting feel while holding up under repeated use and commercial laundering. Whether you're outfitting a large facility or just looking for a dependable bedding solution, Martex ® Simplicity sheets maintain their quality wash after wash .\n\nAvailable in a range of sizes, these sheets are built with thoughtful details that boost performance. In a crowded market, Martex ® Simplicity stands apart—offering comfort you can feel and durability you can trust, all at a price that makes sense.\n\nTrade Agreements Act (TAA) compliant making it eligible for sale to the U.S. government .",
